        "Comparison of Solar Refrigeration Technologies",
        "Global Energy and Environmental Impact",
        "Course Overview and Project Introduction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "title": "Solar Thermal Collectors for Refrigeration",
      "lessons": [
        "Flat-Plate Collectors: Design and Operation",
